{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2023-06-29 09:00:00', 'title': 'DOREMUS+CO NAMES SARAH LENT AS PRESIDENT', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SARAH LENT HAS JOINED DOREMUS+CO, A GLOBAL LEADER IN B2B MARKETING AND COMMUNICATIONS, AS PRESIDENT. SHE FILLS A ROLE THAT HAD PREVIOUSLY BEEN HANDLED BY PAUL HIRSCH, WHO HAS BEEN ELEVATED TO CEO AND RETAINS THE TITLE OF CHIEF CREATIVE OFFICER.'}